Package: cohortBuilder.db
Type: Package
Title: Database Source Layer for 'cohortBuilder'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    c(person('Krystian', 'Igras',
             email = 'krystian8207@gmail.com',
             role = c('cre', 'aut'))
    )
Maintainer: Krystian Igras <krystian8207@gmail.com>
Description: Extends 'cohortBuilder' with a source layer for database tables.
    Cohort filtering steps are translated to 'dbplyr' queries and executed on the
    database server, so no data needs to be pulled into R. Supports the
    'shinyCohortBuilder' graphical interface and offers configurable strategies
    for how intermediate step results are passed between filtering steps.
